(Japanese: '''テレビアニメ版・ポケットモンスター まるかじり ブック''' ''TV Anime Pocket Monsters Big Bite Book'') is a series of books published in Japan by Kids Pocket Books. There are at least 8 books in the series.

Pocket Monsters Big Bite Books contain episode summaries, character profiles, design sketches, and other facts relating to {{aniseries|PTS}} as it aired in Japan.

==Trivia==
* While [[EP038]]'s episode summary is skipped in Big Bite volume 4, the missing episode is acknowledged by the numbering of the other summaries (it skips from [[EP037|37]] to [[EP039|39]]). EP038 was given the same treatment in volume ten of [[Pocket Monsters Film Comic]].
